=== layout: one-panel

# How to be successful

@body

- Attend class
  - I do not formally take attendance, but am aware of absences
  - Show up on time! – let me know if you have to be consistently late
- Use blackboard
  - for lecture slides and other materials
  - blackboard training is available to help learn the system
- Check Your Email!
  - class is cancelled, tests are rescheduled, get help with homework
- Read the book and go over the lectures again
  - I follow the book very closely, so it can only help your understanding
- Review old exams (on blackboard) as preparation
  - review your old exams to see where you went wrong
- Come to my office hours

